          <attvalue for="33" value="+" />
          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.55" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Increased global arms flows linked to the Russia–Ukraine war expand the number and heterogeneity of missile, drone, and electronic systems in regional inventories, raising the probability of misfires, misidentification, and technical failures that cause accidental engagements in the Gulf theater." />
