          <attvalue for="35" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Erosion of coordinated diplomatic positions among Western and multilateral actors over the Ukraine war reduces available multilateral channels and unified messaging, lowering the frequency and scope of coordinated diplomatic initiatives addressing the US–Iran–Gulf tensions." />
