          <attvalue for="29" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Sustained escalation in the Gulf prompts Western governments to rapidly expand and tighten export controls on dual‑use technologies and equipment to deny potential combatants or proxies sensitive capabilities, increasing overall export restriction intensity." />
