          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Sustained escalation drives energy and commodity price spikes and exchange‑rate pressure in exposed economies, producing higher headline inflation and capital outflow risks that prompt monetary authorities to raise policy rates to defend price stability and the currency." />
