          <attvalue for="35" value="0.9" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Escalations in China–West rivalry increase naval patrols, harassment of commercial traffic, and use of gray‑zone tactics in chokepoints (e.g., South China Sea, Malacca), directly raising the incidence and severity of threats to maritime energy logistics." />
