          <attvalue for="29" value="3" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.85" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Heightened geopolitical tension drives a supply risk premium, triggers sanctions and precautionary buying, and disrupts contracted flows, which directly push up aggregate crude oil prices." />
