          <attvalue for="35" value="0.8" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Rising China–West strategic friction drives more naval presence, shadowing, and aggressive signaling in key sea lanes, causing carriers, operators and insurers to reassess and raise perceived maritime transit risk in the Gulf theater." />
