          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Elevated maritime security risk disrupts trade flows and trade finance lines, raises counterparty and collateral risk for banks active in commodity and shipping finance, and leads to higher wholesale funding costs and roll‑over difficulty." />
