          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="An increase in the energy component of inflation pressures central banks toward tighter policy and raises operating costs for compute‑intensive AI firms, which reduces investor risk appetite and the rate of new capital deployment into AI projects across China and the West." />
